NOVA bundles and fetches data from other open-source projects.

sherlock-project/sherlock (MIT License)
  The username site database follows Sherlock's data.json schema, and
  `--refresh-sites` downloads their maintained catalogue directly. The curated
  list in nova_osint/data/sites.json is derived from that file.
  https://github.com/sherlock-project/sherlock

disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains (MIT License)
  The throwaway-mail blocklist is fetched from this project at runtime and
  merged with the small seed list in nova_osint/data/disposable.txt.
  https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains

Public services queried at runtime, each under its own terms:
  rdap.org, Cloudflare DNS, Google Public DNS, crt.sh, SSLMate CertSpotter,
  HackerTarget, RapidDNS, Have I Been Pwned, Shodan InternetDB, ip-api.com,
  the Internet Archive, Gravatar and the GitHub REST API.
